      "short": "Aaliya. $3.5\\times10\\,000=35\\,000\\ \\text{cm}^{2}$.",
      "worked": "The length conversion factor is $100$, so the area conversion factor is $100^{2}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}1\\ \\text{m}^{2}&=100^{2}\\ \\text{cm}^{2}\\\\3.5\\ \\text{m}^{2}&=3.5\\times10\\,000\\ \\text{cm}^{2}\\\\3.5\\ \\text{m}^{2}&=35\\,000\\ \\text{cm}^{2}\\end{align*}$$\nAaliya is correct.",
